codex
A broader 100-seed audit found the frequency outlier had a 4–5% accidental success rate even though the mandatory eight-seed panel happened to miss it. I’m tightening the construction instead of accepting that lucky panel: the within-side decoys will be degree-regular, making every non-core label have exactly the same marginal frequency while preserving seed-specific global structure.
